1
00:00:22,806 --> 00:00:26,690
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:33,705
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,578 --> 00:00:40,716
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,054 --> 00:00:47,063
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,274 --> 00:00:51,195
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,406 --> 00:00:54,497
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,794 --> 00:00:59,029
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,014 --> 00:01:03,922
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,220 --> 00:01:07,106
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,416 --> 00:01:12,198
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,198 --> 00:01:16,778
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,778 --> 00:01:18,777
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:24,762
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,146 --> 00:01:29,457
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,457 --> 00:01:31,965
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,211 --> 00:01:42,428
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,878 --> 00:01:48,712
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,712 --> 00:01:51,630
=Episode 8=

19
00:01:51,959 --> 00:01:52,959
- Changming?
- Changming?

20
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,400
I hate him!

21
00:01:55,719 --> 00:01:57,480
What did my clan do wrong?

22
00:01:58,920 --> 00:01:59,920
That explains it.

23
00:02:01,519 --> 00:02:04,079
Changming stole the cores
of your entire Rakshasa Bird clan.

24
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:05,519
So he gained demonic energy,

25
00:02:06,439 --> 00:02:08,599
using them to bewitch
the villagers of Shanyao

26
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,599
into sacrificing themselves.

27
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:13,159
That way, to outsiders,

28
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,240
it was caused by demonic energy.

29
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:18,080
Changming once came to Jinshan Temple
to study spells,

30
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:20,000
but he was never a disciple.

31
00:02:21,159 --> 00:02:22,280
Since he left the mountain,

32
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:24,080
I always felt something was off.

33
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,840
But I never imagined

34
00:02:27,319 --> 00:02:29,840
he could be so greedy and vile.

35
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:31,800
Is there any way you can help her?

36
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,599
I can perform a rite for her

37
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,400
to enter reincarnation.

38
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,759
I don't need it!

39
00:02:40,759 --> 00:02:42,879
Hatred will only keep you
from reincarnating,

40
00:02:42,879 --> 00:02:44,199
leaving you to roam here forever.

41
00:02:44,879 --> 00:02:45,879
Why put yourself through this?

42
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,680
Your fellow Rakshasa Birds

43
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:50,199
would never want to see you
end up this way.

44
00:02:54,159 --> 00:02:56,319
Could you let go of your hatred?

45
00:02:57,960 --> 00:03:01,439
Besides, my clan is already gone.

46
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:04,000
In pursuit of love,

47
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,120
you were deceived,

48
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,360
causing your clan's ruin.

49
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:07,639
It wasn't your fault.

50
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:10,199
You should pass into reincarnation

51
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,960
to reunite with your clan

52
00:03:12,319 --> 00:03:13,520
and earn their forgiveness.

53
00:03:21,319 --> 00:03:22,400
Monk of Jinshan Temple,

54
00:03:23,879 --> 00:03:24,879
do it.

55
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:52,639
Avenge my clan.

56
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:00,919
Suzhen...

57
00:04:03,719 --> 00:04:07,199
Is sacrificing life for love

58
00:04:09,639 --> 00:04:10,800
really worth it?

59
00:04:18,079 --> 00:04:19,079
Killing her

60
00:04:19,839 --> 00:04:21,519
and wiping out her clan aren't enough?

61
00:04:21,879 --> 00:04:23,839
You even destroyed her soul forever?

62
00:04:23,839 --> 00:04:25,040
Are you even human?

63
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,360
Why did you steal their cores?

64
00:04:33,199 --> 00:04:36,360
And why do you possess
snake demon's spiritual power?

65
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:40,079
Speak!

66
00:04:43,399 --> 00:04:45,879
You asked a lot of questions.

67
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:56,759
If you've got the guts,
kill me right now!

68
00:05:01,839 --> 00:05:02,839
Don't let him bait you.

69
00:05:04,439 --> 00:05:06,560
I'll take him back
to Jinshan Temple tomorrow.

70
00:05:31,184 --> 00:05:33,800
(Blaze Demon Nexus)

71
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,240
Useless trash!

72
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,199
Making me come to save you!

73
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:45,240
My lord, that was an accident.

74
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:48,920
I didn't expect Bai Suzhen to interfere.

75
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,439
Still making excuses?

76
00:05:53,879 --> 00:05:55,399
You are just useless!

77
00:05:55,639 --> 00:05:56,639
Yes.

78
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:59,360
My lord, please give me one more chance!

79
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:03,959
Over the years, for my grand cause,

80
00:06:03,959 --> 00:06:06,600
you've toiled and labored tirelessly.

81
00:06:07,879 --> 00:06:09,680
You've certainly contributed a lot.

82
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:10,680
My lord,

83
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,839
I have no regrets.

84
00:06:16,879 --> 00:06:19,839
Back when everyone looked down on me,

85
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:22,160
it was you who gave me a chance

86
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,160
and helped me cultivate,

87
00:06:24,399 --> 00:06:25,759
so that I could prove myself.

88
00:06:26,319 --> 00:06:28,319
I'm willing to serve your new world

89
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,279
with absolute devotion.

90
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:37,000
It's your sharp mind that I value most.

91
00:06:37,519 --> 00:06:41,480
Then my lord, what should I do next?

92
00:06:50,293 --> 00:06:52,519
(Blaze Demon Nexus)

93
00:06:52,519 --> 00:06:54,959
Understood.

94
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:57,120
Hurry up!

95
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,519
He doesn't listen. What can you do?

96
00:06:58,519 --> 00:06:59,879
Use spell, of course!

97
00:07:03,639 --> 00:07:04,639
Where's the door?

98
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:06,079
Where is he?

99
00:07:06,839 --> 00:07:08,000
Great, the trail's cold again!

100
00:07:08,959 --> 00:07:09,959
I told you not to drag your feet!

101
00:07:11,079 --> 00:07:12,279
I should've known.

102
00:07:12,279 --> 00:07:13,560
I should've kept my eyes on him!

103
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,240
Where's Xu Xian?

104
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:29,360
I'm here to pick up the birthday gift.

105
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,160
What is it?

106
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,160
I'll get it for you.

107
00:07:33,639 --> 00:07:35,000
Who are you?

108
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:37,399
Never mind,
I'll come back this afternoon.

109
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:41,959
Wait, is it Xu Xian's aunt's birthday?

110
00:07:42,199 --> 00:07:43,199
Yeah.

111
00:07:43,199 --> 00:07:45,519
Every year, he has me deliver
cheap trinkets to her,

112
00:07:45,639 --> 00:07:46,680
and insists on staying anonymous.

113
00:07:48,319 --> 00:07:50,240
A bad gift is worse than none at all.

114
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:54,000
People always compare birthday gifts.

115
00:07:54,399 --> 00:07:56,959
The stuff Xu Xian sends
only embarrasses his aunt

116
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,920
and makes him a laughingstock
to his friends.

117
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:01,560
What kind of gift
is considered good, then?

118
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,360
Something so he won't get mocked.

119
00:08:03,759 --> 00:08:05,160
What a question!

120
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:08,160
Zhao family's jade carvings,
for instance.

121
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:11,240
In craftsmanship and quality,
they're top-tier.

122
00:08:11,879 --> 00:08:14,920
Giving that as a gift would
surely bring great prestige.

123
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:18,000
All right, I got it. You may go.

124
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,000
Come back this afternoon.

125
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:21,399
But don't come to Xu Xian. Come to me.

126
00:08:22,279 --> 00:08:24,759
I'll send the gift
on his behalf this year.

127
00:08:27,879 --> 00:08:28,879
Sir.

128
00:08:42,399 --> 00:08:44,200
is this all you have in the shop?

129
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:47,200
I'm looking for a birthday gift
for my aunt,

130
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:50,919
something unique and prestigious.

131
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:53,679
May I have your name, Miss?

132
00:08:56,639 --> 00:08:57,879
I'm Bai Suzhen.

133
00:08:58,799 --> 00:08:59,960
Miss Bai,

134
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,799
I'm Zhao Puxin.

135
00:09:02,279 --> 00:09:04,080
We have plenty of those things!

136
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:07,960
Please take a look, Miss.

137
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,480
How about this?

138
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,480
Or this?

139
00:09:16,039 --> 00:09:18,879
These are still too ordinary.

140
00:09:19,039 --> 00:09:20,200
Do you have anything else?

141
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:26,759
Well, my family has
an heirloom jade carving.

142
00:09:27,039 --> 00:09:30,159
- If you want it...
- The price is negotiable.

143
00:09:30,679 --> 00:09:31,759
This way, Miss.

144
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:32,960
Right this way.

145
00:09:43,799 --> 00:09:46,840
This is a piece of top-grade jade,

146
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:50,480
an heirloom of our Zhao family.

147
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:55,240
I'd never show it to just anyone.

148
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:56,879
Name your price.

149
00:09:57,200 --> 00:10:00,759
A family heirloom is priceless,

150
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:05,639
unless you're willing
to marry into our family...

151
00:10:05,639 --> 00:10:06,679
Get your filthy hands off me!

152
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:07,960
You...

153
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,720
How dare you!

154
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:12,720
You ruined our Zhao family heirloom!

155
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:14,879
What heirloom? I'll pay for it!

156
00:10:14,879 --> 00:10:18,000
Pay for it?
This jade is worth 3,000 taels!

157
00:10:18,159 --> 00:10:19,200
Can you even afford that?

158
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:24,519
Don't have the cash? Marry me instead!

159
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:25,960
In your dreams!

160
00:10:28,639 --> 00:10:30,519
You vicious woman!

161
00:10:30,519 --> 00:10:32,120
How dare you slap me!

162
00:10:35,519 --> 00:10:36,519
What do you want?

163
00:10:41,399 --> 00:10:42,720
I know you're strong.

164
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,879
But breaking his jade carving
was bad enough.

165
00:10:44,879 --> 00:10:46,480
Why did you have to beat him so badly?

166
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,919
Do you know you could
end up in court for this?

167
00:10:51,879 --> 00:10:53,600
Why did you mess with someone like him?

168
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:55,200
Now he's badmouthing you everywhere.

169
00:10:58,039 --> 00:10:59,840
Why keep criticizing me?

170
00:11:00,559 --> 00:11:02,320
Don't you care if I got hurt?

171
00:11:05,399 --> 00:11:08,759
Well... are you hurt?

172
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,480
No.

173
00:11:15,919 --> 00:11:17,639
I just wanted to buy that jade,

174
00:11:17,759 --> 00:11:18,799
but he refused to sell it to me

175
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:20,440
and tried to grope me!

176
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,000
Grope you?

177
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,440
Did he lay a hand on you?

178
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,480
He wouldn't dare!

179
00:11:26,039 --> 00:11:27,919
I should've trashed his entire shop!

180
00:11:29,799 --> 00:11:32,879
That jade carries a bond
money can't buy.

181
00:11:33,159 --> 00:11:35,399
The Zhao family's ancestor
carved it for his late wife.

182
00:11:35,879 --> 00:11:37,360
They started with nothing,

183
00:11:37,679 --> 00:11:38,679
enduring hardships together.

184
00:11:39,519 --> 00:11:41,919
When he became the capital's
master craftsman,

185
00:11:43,879 --> 00:11:45,559
his beloved wife died of illness.

186
00:11:46,399 --> 00:11:47,559
After she passed away,

187
00:11:47,919 --> 00:11:50,879
he carved all his longing into the jade

188
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:55,240
and died of heartbreak shortly after.

189
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:01,200
To think such devotion exists
in this world.

190
00:12:02,679 --> 00:12:03,840
When one is gone,

191
00:12:04,879 --> 00:12:06,519
the other can't bear to live on.

192
00:12:07,279 --> 00:12:08,960
So, Miss Bai,

193
00:12:09,519 --> 00:12:11,759
it was never about the 3,000 taels.

194
00:12:12,879 --> 00:12:15,600
Fine, I'll buy
another piece of fine jade,

195
00:12:16,039 --> 00:12:17,039
hire a master craftsman,

196
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:18,679
and have him carve an identical one.

197
00:12:18,679 --> 00:12:19,679
Wouldn't that work?

198
00:12:20,759 --> 00:12:22,399
Why can't you understand?

199
00:12:22,639 --> 00:12:24,240
It's not about the jade either.

200
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:27,200
It's about the true love behind it!

201
00:12:30,919 --> 00:12:31,919
Xu Xian,

202
00:12:32,679 --> 00:12:35,799
what does true love mean to you?

203
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,840
I don't know, and I don't care to know.

204
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:42,720
Then

205
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,840
what do you hate most?

206
00:12:48,759 --> 00:12:49,759
Lie.

207
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:53,639
What if it's a white lie?

208
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:55,840
It's still a lie.

209
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:58,879
What if there was no other choice?

210
00:12:59,399 --> 00:13:00,399
You just don't get it.

211
00:13:00,919 --> 00:13:02,639
What do you mean?

212
00:13:02,919 --> 00:13:03,919
Just stay out of this.

213
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,759
I'll handle the jade issue.

214
00:13:08,399 --> 00:13:09,559
I don't need you to!

215
00:13:29,279 --> 00:13:30,720
Come take a look. How about this one?

216
00:13:46,759 --> 00:13:49,279
It looks nothing like it. Not at all.

217
00:13:49,399 --> 00:13:51,399
Fahai, do the math!

218
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:53,080
How many of my stones have you ruined?

219
00:13:53,399 --> 00:13:56,159
Do you expect me to send
my demon minions to gather more?

220
00:13:59,679 --> 00:14:00,679
I quit!

221
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,720
You can't carve it right either,

222
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,120
yet all you do is boss me around!

223
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:06,120
If it weren't for this,

224
00:14:06,279 --> 00:14:08,440
would I, the head lay disciple
of Jinshan Temple,

225
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:09,879
ever let you boss me around?

226
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,799
Save your breath.

227
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,360
Sit down.

228
00:14:20,879 --> 00:14:21,879
Keep carving!

229
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:26,759
Shutting the door the second you see me?

230
00:14:27,879 --> 00:14:30,000
Did you think Miss Bai was back?

231
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:33,759
I'll tear this wretched door
down one day!

232
00:14:34,759 --> 00:14:36,039
Aunt, give it up.

233
00:14:36,039 --> 00:14:37,080
I won't return with you.

234
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:40,799
I heard everything outside just now.

235
00:14:41,559 --> 00:14:43,120
You fought with Miss Bai again.

236
00:14:43,559 --> 00:14:45,120
She's such a wonderful woman.

237
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:48,720
Aunt, why are you really here?

238
00:14:50,279 --> 00:14:52,360
I heard about the Zhao family incident,

239
00:14:52,919 --> 00:14:55,000
so I came to talk it over with you.

240
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:57,039
You have a family.

241
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:00,279
Don't carry everything on your own.

242
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:02,759
If you're just here to meddle,

243
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:04,080
please leave.

244
00:15:04,879 --> 00:15:05,879
Kicking me out again?

245
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:10,200
Do you know why Miss Bai
went to buy that jade carving?

246
00:15:15,519 --> 00:15:17,080
So unreasonable and stubborn.

247
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:18,600
Just my bad luck.

248
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:20,519
Qing, let's go.

249
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:23,360
What happened?

250
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:28,919
Young Master Xu and Miss Bai must've

251
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:31,399
quarreled over the jade carving.

252
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:34,960
I'm leaving.

253
00:15:36,399 --> 00:15:38,200
Suzhen, where are we going?

254
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:40,320
You just go?

255
00:15:40,559 --> 00:15:42,120
Undo the curse on me first!

256
00:15:43,159 --> 00:15:44,159
Hey!

257
00:15:46,039 --> 00:15:47,200
Come back and undo the curse!

258
00:16:18,023 --> 00:16:22,182
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

259
00:16:24,649 --> 00:16:29,027
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

260
00:16:30,570 --> 00:16:36,395
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

261
00:16:37,164 --> 00:16:41,631
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

262
00:16:44,496 --> 00:16:48,937
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

263
00:16:51,133 --> 00:16:55,863
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

264
00:16:57,075 --> 00:17:03,188
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

265
00:17:03,851 --> 00:17:09,633
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

266
00:17:09,633 --> 00:17:15,896
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

267
00:17:16,206 --> 00:17:22,565
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

268
00:17:22,736 --> 00:17:30,103
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

269
00:17:30,388 --> 00:17:35,935
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

270
00:17:36,426 --> 00:17:42,636
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

271
00:17:42,946 --> 00:17:49,719
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

272
00:17:50,716 --> 00:17:56,369
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

273
00:17:57,203 --> 00:18:01,611
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

274
00:18:02,376 --> 00:18:04,964
♪Having ever loved♪
